0%81%E4%B8%8B%EF%BC%8C%E8%AF%86%E4%B9%8B%E5%BE%8B%E8%80%85%E8%8E%B7%E5%BE%97%E9%A2%9D%E5%A4%96%E7%9A%84%E6%8B%9B%E5%BC%8F%EF%BC%8C%E9%80%9A%E8%BF%87%E6%94%B9%E5%8F%98%E5%90%8E%E7%9A%84%E8%BE%93%E5%87%BA%E6%A8%A1%E5%BC%8F%EF%BC%8C%E9%85%8D%E5%90%88%E3%80%90%E8%BA%AB%E4%B8%BA%E7%99%BE%E5%85%B5%E3%80%91%E6%8F%90%E4%BE%9B%E7%9A%84%E5%A2%9E%E4%BC%A4%EF%BC%8C%E5%A4%A7%E5%B9%85%E6%8F%90%E9%AB%98%E4%BA%86%E8%A7%92%E8%89%B2%E7%9A%84%E8%BE%93%E5%87%BA%E8%83%BD%E5%8A%9B%E3%80%82%3C%2Fp%3E%22%2C%22img%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fact-upload.mihoyo.com%2Fbh3-wiki%2F2023%2F09%2F27%2F282941837%2Fca0c007ef05efbf550a96f3900594bc3_6064653363313862619.gif%22%7D%7D%5D\" data-ts=\"1695819223176\" data-col-type=\"l2r1\"><div style=\"order: 0;\"> <div data-part=\"role\" data-tmpl=\"weapon\" class=\"obc-tmpl__part obc-tmpl-weapon obc-tmpl__part--role obc-tmpl__part--align-banner\"><h2>适用角色</h2> <table class=\"obc-tmpl__gain-method obc-tmpl-weapon__role-table\"><colgroup><col> <col></colgroup> <tbody><tr><td class=\"h3\"><div class=\"role-icon-td\"><div><img src=\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/bh3-wiki/2023/09/27/282941837/d173526d7e8c2c2a44046f2d1b4b48ac_974553661837501665.png\" alt=\"\"></div> <span>识之律者</span></div></td> <td><div class=\"obc-tmpl-weapon__role-stars\"><span>推荐指数</span> <div><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i></div></div></td> <td colspan=\"3\" class=\"obc-tmpl__rich-text\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">最佳推荐武器，全方面提升了角色的输出和循环能力，改变了角色爆发状态下的输出流程，提升极大。</p></td></tr></tbody></table> <!----></div></div><div style=\"order: 1;\"> <div data-part=\"review\" data-tmpl=\"weapon\" class=\"obc-tmpl__part obc-tmpl-weapon obc-tmpl__part--review obc-tmpl__part--align-banner\"><h2>武器测评</h2> <div class=\"obc-tmpl-valkyrie__skill-container\"><div><img src=\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/bh3-wiki/2023/09/27/282941837/ca0c007ef05efbf550a96f3900594bc3_6064653363313862619.gif\" class=\"mobile-gif\"></div> <div class=\"obc-tmpl-valkyrie__skill-item\"><div class=\"obc-tmpl-valkyrie__skill-item-desc\"><div class=\"text\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">物理特性的输出向拳套超限神之键。常驻暴击率和爆发状态下的物伤。识之律者装备时，使用武器技提供回能，配合非爆发状态下使用武器技获取的【盛气】效果，使识之律者在必杀技或爆发状态下的攻击可以获取SP，加快了角色的回转；【身为百兵】提高了识之律者自身的加成（如【入世出世皆随心】等）的覆盖率，且爆发状态下，识之律者获得额外的招式，通过改变后的输出模式，配合【身为百兵】提供的增伤，大幅提高了角色的输出能力。</p></div> <div class=\"obc-tmpl-valkyrie__skill-item-desc-gif\" style=\"padding: 0px;\"><img src=\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/bh3-wiki/2023/09/27/282941837/ca0c007ef05efbf550a96f3900594bc3_6064653363313862619.gif\" alt=\"\"></div></div></div></div> <!----></div></div></div></div></div> <div data-v-f0365338=\"\" class=\"detail__body-endpart\"><hr data-v-f0365338=\"\"> <p data-v-f0365338=\"\" class=\"detail__copyright\"><img data-v-f0365338=\"\" src=\"data:image/png;base64,\">\n        词条内容由圣芙蕾雅档案馆编辑团队原创，禁止转载\n      </p></div> <!---->",
